<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 26 August <span class="n">9</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ottokar-ii-of-bohemia"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ottokar-ii-of-bohemia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ottokar II of Bohemia</span><span class="tp">c. 1233–1278</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/louis-i-count-of-flanders"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/louis-i-count-of-flanders.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Louis I, Count of Flanders</span><span class="tp">c. 1304–1346</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/john-of-bohemia"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/john-of-bohemia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">John of Bohemia</span><span class="tp">1296–1346</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/antonio-prior-of-crato"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/antonio-prior-of-crato.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">António, Prior of Crato</span><span class="tp">1531–1595</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/frans-hals"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/frans-hals.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Frans Hals</span><span class="tp">c. 1582–1666</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/antonie-van-leeuwenhoek"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/antonie-van-leeuwenhoek.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Antonie van Leeuwenhoek</span><span class="tp">1632–1723</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/santiago-de-liniers"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/santiago-de-liniers.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Santiago de Liniers</span><span class="tp">1753–1810</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/louis-philippe-i"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/louis-philippe-i.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Louis Philippe I</span><span class="tp">1773–1850</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/gaston-thorn"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/gaston-thorn.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Gaston Thorn</span><span class="tp">1928–2007</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
